Generate from Cott contracts; preserve declared types, errors, effects, and invariants.
Iterate/index CottList; type empty CottLists; use pathlib.Path; exhaustively match; never redeclare locals.
cott-domain real.yt_dlp.apply_update return: On CPython POSIX, os.replace supports src_dir_fd/dst_dir_fd even though os.replace itself is absent from os.supports_dir_fd; os.rename is the listed operation for that facility. Check os.rename support, use descriptor-relative os.replace, and do not reject a supported platform because its alias is unlisted.
cott-domain real.yt_dlp.build_shortcut_url return: After matching Search and SearchAll, the remaining ShortcutKind variant is Url; use that branch directly, without a redundant isinstance(ShortcutKind_Url) check or unreachable fallback, which the pinned type checker reports.
cott-domain real.yt_dlp.resolve_authentication return: Dispatch on request.kind with an exhaustive match over the AuthenticationKind variants; an isinstance check on the only remaining variant, or a fallback after all variants, fails the pinned type checker's reportUnnecessaryIsInstance.
cott-domain real.yt_dlp.run return: Preserve the exact Cott Never projection as typing.Never, not typing.NoReturn. Runtime signature comparison distinguishes these annotations even when a type checker treats them as equivalent.
cott-domain real.yt_dlp.write_download_archive return: On CPython POSIX, os.replace supports src_dir_fd/dst_dir_fd even though os.replace itself is absent from os.supports_dir_fd; os.rename is the listed operation for that facility. Check os.rename support, use descriptor-relative os.replace, and do not reject a supported platform because its alias is unlisted.
